Error [E0960]: `settings` is not a module namespace
  --> tests/ui/module_unknown_namespace.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     settings.dev: Env {
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: a module contributes to exactly three reserved namespaces: `env` (a dev environment), `system` (a whole machine), and `image` (a disk image)
 Fix: begin the contribution with `env`, `system`, or `image`
